> A further question regarding clan mechanics; I seem to be in my clan and
> other people seem to be in it, but when I go to the clan information
> page, no members were shown until recently, when one member started
> being shown.  People from last year who are invited are unable to accept
> the invitation and get added to the list, and also don't seem to be able
> to leave the clan. Should we be expecting this to work yet?

Most database entries have a 'tyear' field, specifying whether that 
entry has been activated for the current year.  Player accounts with 
last year's tyear aren't visible anywhere, and aren't technically clan 
members until they reactivate.  Invitations from last year aren't usable 
this year.

Since this is the first time most of the reactivation code's really 
being used, there will definitely be some kinks to work out.  Sorry.

